# Part 10j's measurement (ADR-0396 item 8, ADR-0397's architect decision): the cost of
# hashing the bytes the loader receives, for a program of 64.3 MB (61.3 MiB; the loader takes 64 MiB at
# most), a tcc program with 63 MB of initialised data. Not a step of make test: `make test-posix POSIX_SCRIPTS=tests/posix/zosh-measure-install.script
# POSIX_IMAGE_SIZE=640M`; the numbers are in the log (`uptime` lines) and in
# docs/tasks/TASK-31-part-10j.md. The same file is started by its installed name (check, load,
# run) and by its path (load, run), three times each; the difference is the hash.
! panicked
! ZORAYA-FAULT
! -FAIL
